    "CRLF to LF",
    "literal mat_fp4 to mixed_w2w4_moe_ffn in relative paths and file contents",
    "restore compiler-default DCache maintenance in run_mixed_w2w4_moe_ffn_esl.sh",
    "require both Gate and Down stages for the full-core SyncAll barrier in both kernel entries",
    "remove trailing whitespace and correct comment spelling without changing native kernel logic",
    "format Python helpers and replace ASCII-only regular expressions with equivalent character-set checks",
    "correct integration provenance, standalone case descriptions and documented comparator defaults",
    "version full-FFN tiling ABI to v3, append runtime SwiGLU limit and version device entry symbols",
    "clip Gate upper bound and Up both bounds for W2/W4 while preserving BF16/FP32/MXFP8 rounding and pre-clamp invalid markers",
    "enable resident precision stages even for empty experts; pair standalone golden and runtime limit",
    "document complete routed-FFN bridge integration and update CPU numerical checks"
  ],
